[00:04.50]Ghari meri time dasse tere shehar da
[00:09.50]Aithe adhi raat te othe deed dupehr da
[00:14.50]Tere pichhe jaagne 'ch aa reha swaad
[00:19.50]Waise chheti mera dil taan kitte ni thehron da
[00:25.00]Dil kare aawan tere kol udd ke
[00:29.50]Lake de kinare baithan naal judd ke
[00:34.50]Hath phadd tera photo khichni dobara
[00:39.00]Par Insta te post ni paauni mud ke
[00:44.00]Aisi setting baithi ae apni
[00:48.50]Suiyan khadi diyan taan ni chhediyan
[00:53.00]Sacche pyaar 'chon nikalna main
